      "instance_name": "mourning_scene",
      "label": "a woman in mourning",
      "description": "A woman is depicted in a state of grief, holding a white cloth to her face. She is wearing a black top and a pearl necklace, and her posture and expression convey deep sorrow. The image is tightly cropped, focusing on her upper body and face to emphasize her emotional state. Overlaid text inaccurately frames the victims of the Christchurch mosque shootings as exclusively Muslim, promoting a hateful and misleading narrative.",
